  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_23": "[RUBY:BASE ]障壁[RUBY:BEGIN ]しょうへき[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]妖域[RUBY:BEGIN ]よういき[RUBY:END ]",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_30": "[RUBY:BASE ]怨念[RUBY:BEGIN ]おんねん[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]妖域[RUBY:BEGIN ]よういき[RUBY:END ]",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CHESHIRE_TXT_04": "【[RUBY:BASE ]手[RUBY:BEGIN ]て[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]入[RUBY:BEGIN ]い[RUBY:END ]れるには……】\r\nチェシャのスキルをたくさん[RUBY:BASE ]覚[RUBY:BEGIN ]おぼ[RUBY:END ]えると……？",
