  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0034_001_H34": "うーん、うまく[RUBY:BASE ]声[RUBY:BEGIN ]こえ[RUBY:END ]が[RUBY:BASE ]出[RUBY:BEGIN ]で[RUBY:END ]ないなぁ……。\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]魔女[RUBY:BEGIN ]まじょ[RUBY:END ]さん、お[RUBY:BASE ]薬持[RUBY:BEGIN ]くすりも[RUBY:END ]ってたりしない？",
