  "CORE_DIALOG_TXT_121": "セレッサの[RUBY:BASE ]衣装[RUBY:BEGIN ]いしょう[RUBY:END ]「[RUBY:BASE ]時[RUBY:BEGIN ]とき[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]旅人[RUBY:BEGIN ]たびびと[RUBY:END ]」\r\nを[RUBY:BASE ]手[RUBY:BEGIN ]て[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]入[RUBY:BEGIN ]い[RUBY:END ]れました！",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_10": "[RUBY:BASE ]幻術[RUBY:BEGIN ]げんじゅつ[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]妖域[RUBY:BEGIN ]よういき[RUBY:END ]",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_03": "[RUBY:BASE ]戦禍[RUBY:BEGIN ]せんか[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]妖域[RUBY:BEGIN ]よういき[RUBY:END ]",
  "CORE_WH_TALK_16_COL": "おねえちゃん、ネコさん、いつもありがとう！\r\nお[RUBY:BASE ]礼[RUBY:BEGIN ]れい[RUBY:END ]にこれをあげるね！",
