  "CORE_SNPSS_6030": "[RUBY:BASE ]本性[RUBY:BEGIN ]ほんしょう[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]表[RUBY:BEGIN ]あらわ[RUBY:END ]し、チェシャの[RUBY:BASE ]魂[RUBY:BEGIN ]たましい[RUBY:END ]を\r\nいけにえにするために[RUBY:BASE ]二人[RUBY:BEGIN ]ふたり[RUBY:END ]へと\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]牙[RUBY:BEGIN ]きば[RUBY:END ]をむくモルガナ。セレッサは\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]覚悟[RUBY:BEGIN ]かくご[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]決[RUBY:BEGIN ]き[RUBY:END ]め[RUBY:BASE ]彼女[RUBY:BEGIN ]かのじょ[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]迎[RUBY:BEGIN ]むか[RUBY:END ]え[RUBY:BASE ]撃[RUBY:BEGIN ]う[RUBY:END ]ちます。",
  "CORE_WISP_TALK_36_H22": "あれ、[RUBY:BASE ]動[RUBY:BEGIN ]うご[RUBY:END ]けるようになった……？\r\nああ、[RUBY:BASE ]君[RUBY:BEGIN ]きみ[RUBY:END ]が[RUBY:BASE ]助[RUBY:BEGIN ]たす[RUBY:END ]けてくれたんだねー。ありがとねー",
  "AC_NARRATION250_0010": "[RUBY:BASE ]不気味[RUBY:BEGIN ]ぶきみ[RUBY:END ]な[RUBY:BASE ]森[RUBY:BEGIN ]もり[RUBY:END ]とはうってかわって、\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]静[RUBY:BEGIN ]しず[RUBY:END ]かに[RUBY:BASE ]波[RUBY:BEGIN ]なみ[RUBY:END ]が[RUBY:BASE ]打[RUBY:BEGIN ]う[RUBY:END ]ち[RUBY:BASE ]寄[RUBY:BEGIN ]よ[RUBY:END ]せる、[RUBY:BASE ]色鮮[RUBY:BEGIN ]いろあざ[RUBY:END ]やかな[RUBY:BASE ]浜辺[RUBY:BEGIN ]はまべ[RUBY:END ]。",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_12_H00": "うーん、あとちょっと！　もう[RUBY:BASE ]一人[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひとり[RUBY:END ]いれば、\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]扉[RUBY:BEGIN ]とびら[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]開[RUBY:BEGIN ]あ[RUBY:END ]けられそうなんだけど……",
  "CORE_HTDMMESS_0004_003_H04": "[RUBY:BASE ]助[RUBY:BEGIN ]たす[RUBY:END ]かった……え、[RUBY:BASE ]秘密基地[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひみつきち[RUBY:END ]？　[RUBY:BASE ]君[RUBY:BEGIN ]きみ[RUBY:END ]、[RUBY:BASE ]道[RUBY:BEGIN ]みち[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]知[RUBY:BEGIN ]し[RUBY:END ]ってるの！？\r\nやった！　ここで[RUBY:BASE ]隠[RUBY:BEGIN ]かく[RUBY:END ]れるよりよっぽど[RUBY:BASE ]安全[RUBY:BEGIN ]あんぜん[RUBY:END ]だぞ！",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_14": "[RUBY:BASE ]致命[RUBY:BEGIN ]ちめい[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]妖域[RUBY:BEGIN ]よういき[RUBY:END ]",
  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_07": "[RUBY:BASE ]剛槍[RUBY:BEGIN ]ごうそう[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]妖域[RUBY:BEGIN ]よういき[RUBY:END ]",
  "TA_COM015_0010_CER": "そうだ！",
  "CORE_RETRY_TXT_02": "このティルナノーグに[RUBY:BASE ]再挑戦[RUBY:BEGIN ]さいちょうせん[RUBY:END ]しますか？",
  "TEST_WISP_TALK_08": "サーカスの[RUBY:BASE ]団長[RUBY:BEGIN ]だんちょう[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]見[RUBY:BEGIN ]み[RUBY:END ]つかったら……うう。\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]気[RUBY:BEGIN ]き[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]付[RUBY:BEGIN ]つ[RUBY:END ]けて、おねえちゃん……",
