  "AC_CEREZA060_0020": "アンタ、[RUBY:BASE ]不器用[RUBY:BEGIN ]ぶきよう[RUBY:END ]ね。[RUBY:BASE ]人[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひと[RUBY:END ]のこと[RUBY:BASE ]笑[RUBY:BEGIN ]わら[RUBY:END ]えないわ",
