  "CORE_ILLUSIONLIFT_NAME_TXT_41": "[RUBY:BASE ]剛槍[RUBY:BEGIN ]ごうそう[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]試練[RUBY:BEGIN ]しれん[RUBY:END ]",
  "CORE_CSRELEASE_CERESSA_TXT_07": "【[RUBY:BASE ]手[RUBY:BEGIN ]て[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]入[RUBY:BEGIN ]い[RUBY:END ]れるには……】\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]禁[RUBY:BEGIN ]きん[RUBY:END ]じられた[RUBY:BASE ]伝説[RUBY:BEGIN ]でんせつ[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]読破[RUBY:BEGIN ]どくは[RUBY:END ]すると……？",
