  "AC_IGNIS015_0010": "[RUBY:BASE ]森[RUBY:BEGIN ]もり[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]冒険[RUBY:BEGIN ]ぼうけん[RUBY:END ]は[RUBY:BASE ]順調[RUBY:BEGIN ]じゅんちょう[RUBY:END ]かな？\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]秘密[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひみつ[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]抜[RUBY:BEGIN ]ぬ[RUBY:END ]け[RUBY:BASE ]道[RUBY:BEGIN ]みち[RUBY:END ]も、[RUBY:BASE ]有効[RUBY:BEGIN ]ゆうこう[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]使[RUBY:BEGIN ]つか[RUBY:END ]っておくれよ",
